This product bundles the SpinDoctor Qwerty engine 1.1.0, a pure-Python (standard library only) port of the
SpinDoctor 3.1.2 quantum-circuit simulator semantics (update 3.1.2-298-20261010), by the same author.

SpinDoctor is a CLASSICAL simulator: it runs FP64 arithmetic on an ordinary computer. It is not a quantum computer,
does not connect to quantum hardware, and claims no quantum speed-up or quantum advantage.

Third-party names (host applications, file formats, protocols) are trademarks of their respective owners and are used
only to describe compatibility. No third-party code is vendored in this repository except where stated in README.md.

